    answer: fplain(G10_A),
    explain: `$\\frac{dy}{dx} = 2ax + 1$, which is $2a + 1$ at $x = 1$. Setting $2a + 1 = ${fplain(G10.m)}$ gives $a = ${fplain(G10_A)}$.`,
