    answer: fplain(MEET.we3.x),
    explain: `The repeated factor $(x - 1)^{2}$ is the touching point, so the crossing is at ${M(`x = ${fplain(MEET.we3.x)}`)}, where ${M(`y = ${fplain(MEET.we3.y)}`)}.`,
